"onboarding.quit" = "Quit";

"onboarding.body" = "1. Mounting NTFS writable or formatting it can damage data. Back up first.
2. Bundled FUSE-T go-nfsv4 is not GPL and is for personal use by default. Before distributing or selling this as a product, you must obtain written permission from FUSE-T (https://www.fuse-t.org/). This package is not currently a redistributable product.
3. By default this app does not use the network or collect accounts. If you enable “Check for Updates Automatically” or choose “Check for Updates…”, the app contacts GitHub for the Sparkle appcast (pre-release v1.2.0 asset, not GitHub Latest). Disk contents are not uploaded. Logs stay on this Mac. After you uninstall the app, log files remain in your user folder.
4. The mount helper runs as a root daemon and can mount, unmount, and format external disks. The administrator password entered at install time is not saved.

On first use, click “Install…” in the window to install the mount helper. Un-notarized builds ask for an administrator password; notarized builds prefer system service authorization.

Return means you agree. Click “Quit” if you do not.";

