"helper.privilegeHint" = "The mount helper runs as root and can mount, unmount, and format external disks. The administrator password is used only for one-time install and is not saved. The Unix socket is mode 0666 so this app can connect as a normal user; the daemon checks the caller against the CDHash written at install time and only runs the root-owned helper copy under /Library/Application Support/NTFSMount/. It does not write sudoers. Uninstall: “Uninstall Helper” above, or uninstall.sh in the repo. Logs are at ~/Library/Logs/ntfsmount.log and remain on this Mac after uninstall.";

